{"id":"KB-0043","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"hard","question":"我的 JoyClean S1 固件升级一直失败，该怎么处理？升级失败造成的故障在保修范围吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"先确认 2.4 GHz 网络稳定并保持设备通电后重试；升级后异常先重启设备。仍异常联系客服：若属保修期内因升级导致的故障，按保修政策处理（换新判定需 L2 审批）。","expected_facts":["升级需保持设备通电、2.4 GHz 网络稳定","升级后异常先重启设备，仍异常联系客服","保修期内因升级导致的故障按保修政策处理，换新需 L2 审批"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/05_智能家居服务/固件升级政策.md","knowledge-base/04_售后服务/保修政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["升级流程","升级后异常","需人工介入或审批的场景"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-SMARTHOME-003","YX-AFTERSALE-003"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents","state_conditions"],"metadata":{"domain":"smarthome","product":"JoyClean S1","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0044","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"JoyClean V1 的 HEPA 滤网多久换一次？换滤网在保修范围内吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"HEPA 滤网建议每 6 个月更换（每 1–2 个月清洁一次）。滤网属于易耗件，正常损耗不在保修范围。","expected_facts":["V1 HEPA 滤网每 6 个月更换","滤网等易耗件不在保修范围"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/01_产品资料/JoyClean_V1无线吸尘器.md","knowledge-base/04_售后服务/保修政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["清洁和保养要求","不保范围"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-PRODUCT-V1-001","YX-AFTERSALE-003"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents"],"metadata":{"domain":"aftersales","product":"JoyClean V1","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0045","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"7 天无理由退货，寄回去的运费谁出？退款会退运费吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"7 天无理由退货的寄回运费由客户承担，退款只退商品金额、不含该运费；质量问题和品牌责任则运费由品牌承担并退还客户垫付运费。","expected_facts":["无理由退货寄回运费客户承担","无理由退货退款不含寄回运费","质量问题/品牌责任寄回运费由品牌承担"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/04_售后服务/退换货政策.md","knowledge-base/04_售后服务/退款政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["运费承担","退款金额"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-AFTERSALE-002","YX-AFTERSALE-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents","state_conditions"],"metadata":{"domain":"aftersales","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0046","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"JoyBrew C1 多久要除垢一次？用什么除垢？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"建议每周执行一次除垢程序，使用官方除垢剂 DC-COMMON-01。","expected_facts":[{"label":"JoyBrew C1 建议每周除垢","all_of":[{"any_of":["JoyBrew C1","C1"]},{"any_of":["每周","一周"]},{"any_of":["除垢"]}]},{"label":"使用 DC-COMMON-01 除垢剂","all_of":[{"any_of":["DC-COMMON-01"]},{"any_of":["除垢剂","专用除垢剂"]}]}],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/01_产品资料/JoyBrew_C1智能咖啡机.md","knowledge-base/01_产品资料/配件目录.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["清洁和保养要求","常见错误代码","通用配件（可跨型号使用）"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-PRODUCT-C1-001","YX-ACCESSORY-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents"],"metadata":{"domain":"product","product":"JoyBrew C1","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0047","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"hard","question":"一笔 2000 马币的退款申请，客服能直接处理吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"不能直接处理。单笔退款达到大额标准（≥ RM1,500 或等值当地货币）需 L2 主管审批；客服不得承诺审批结果。","expected_facts":["大额退款标准 ≥ RM1,500 等值","大额退款需 L2 主管审批","审批结果出来前客服不得承诺"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/04_售后服务/退款政策.md","knowledge-base/06_客户服务/人工介入与升级政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["需人工介入或审批的场景（退款类）","必须升级的场景（统一清单）","审批纪律"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-AFTERSALE-001","YX-CS-003"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","apply_approval_rule"],"metadata":{"domain":"aftersales","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0048","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"hard","question":"我的订单已经发货了，还能取消吗？取消后怎么退款？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"已发货（未签收）订单可联系客服申请拒收，包裹退回后按退款流程处理；已产生的承运费用可能在退款中扣除。退款方式与到账时间按退款政策执行。","expected_facts":[{"label":"已发货未签收可拒收","all_of":[{"any_of":["已发货","发货后"]},{"any_of":["未签收","尚未签收","没有签收"]},{"any_of":["拒收","拒绝签收"]}]},{"label":"包裹退回后按退款流程处理","all_of":[{"any_of":["包裹退回后","退回后","退件后"]},{"any_of":["退款流程","按退款处理","进入退款"]}]},{"label":"已产生的承运费用在退款中扣除（如有）","all_of":[{"any_of":["承运费用","物流费用","运费"]},{"any_of":["退款中扣除","从退款扣除","退款时扣除"]},{"any_of":["如有","若产生","如产生"]}]},{"label":"退款到账时效按支付方式说明","all_of":[{"any_of":["退款到账时效","到账时效","退款时效",{"regex":"退款(?:方式与|到账)?时效"}]},{"any_of":["电子钱包","钱包"]},{"any_of":["银行卡","银行处理"]},{"any_of":["工作日","到账时间"]}],"numbers":["3","5","10"]}],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/03_订单与物流/取消订单政策.md","knowledge-base/04_售后服务/退款政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["取消时机与处理","退款时效","退款方式与时效"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-ORDER-003","YX-AFTERSALE-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents","state_conditions"],"metadata":{"domain":"order","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0049","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"hard","question":"发票丢了，还能保修吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"可以。订单号或发票任选其一即可作为保修凭证；如果两者都没有，按「无凭证」流程处理，需 L2 审批并核实购买记录。","expected_facts":["订单号或发票任选其一可保修","无凭证需 L2 审批"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/04_售后服务/保修政策.md","knowledge-base/04_售后服务/退换货政策.md","knowledge-base/06_客户服务/人工介入与升级政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["保修凭证","特殊退货（需人工介入或审批）","必须升级的场景（统一清单）"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-AFTERSALE-003","YX-AFTERSALE-002","YX-CS-003"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents"],"metadata":{"domain":"aftersales","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0050","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"我在马来西亚买的机器，能拿到新加坡保修吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"可以。在任一销售国（MY/SG/TH/ID/VN）购买的产品，其余四国均可享受同等保修（跨境互保）。","expected_facts":[{"label":"5 国任一购买的产品其余四国同等保修","all_of":[{"any_of":["五个销售国","5 个销售国","五国","五个市场","五个国家"]},{"any_of":["任一销售国购买","任一国家购买"]},{"any_of":["其余四国","其他四国"]},{"any_of":["同等保修","相同保修"]}]}],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/04_售后服务/保修政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["跨境互保"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-AFTERSALE-003"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","state_facts"],"metadata":{"domain":"aftersales","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0051","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"JoyAir A1 能用旋转烤叉吗？配件和 A1 Pro 通用吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"不能。旋转烤叉（SP-A1P-01）与转笼是 A1 Pro 专属配件，A1 不支持；且 A1 与 A1 Pro 的炸篮、烤架也不通用。","expected_facts":["旋转烤叉/转笼仅 A1 Pro 可用","A1 与 A1 Pro 炸篮、烤架不通用"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/01_产品资料/JoyAir_A1智能空气炸锅.md","knowledge-base/01_产品资料/配件目录.md","knowledge-base/产品主数据.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["产品限制","空气炸锅配件（JoyAir 系列）","§12 配件兼容摘要"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-PRODUCT-A1-001","YX-ACCESSORY-001","YX-MASTER-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","state_compatibility"],"metadata":{"domain":"accessory","product":"JoyAir A1","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0052","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"hard","question":"维修报价超过了订单金额的一半，怎么处理？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"维修费用超过订单金额 50% 时需 L2 审批，并与客户确认是否继续维修；客服不得口头承诺价格。","expected_facts":["维修费用超过订单金额 50% 需 L2 审批","与客户确认是否继续","客服不得口头承诺价格"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/04_售后服务/维修政策.md","knowledge-base/06_客户服务/人工介入与升级政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["需人工介入或审批的场景","保修外维修","必须升级的场景（统一清单）"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-AFTERSALE-004","YX-CS-003"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","apply_approval_rule"],"metadata":{"domain":"aftersales","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0053","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"hard","question":"我的空气炸锅使用时冒烟了，应该怎么办？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"立即停止使用并断电；登记事件信息（型号、SKU、购买时间、现象、照片）；24 小时内由 L3 安全团队联系客户，视情况安排返厂检测、换新或进一步评估。","expected_facts":["严重安全问题立即停止使用并断电","24 小时内 L3 安全团队联系客户","登记事件信息并全程留痕"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/06_客户服务/人工介入与升级政策.md","knowledge-base/04_售后服务/保修政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["安全事件流程（严重安全问题）","必须升级的场景（统一清单）","需人工介入或审批的场景"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-CS-003","YX-AFTERSALE-003"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","escalate_immediately"],"metadata":{"domain":"service","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0054","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"JoyClean S1 的地图功能对网络有要求吗？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"有。S1 的配网与地图功能必须使用 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi；公网中断不影响本地基本操作，但远程控制与地图同步依赖网络。","expected_facts":["S1 配网与地图功能必须使用 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi","公网中断不影响本地基本操作","远程控制与地图同步依赖网络"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/05_智能家居服务/Wi-Fi与配网支持.md","knowledge-base/01_产品资料/JoyClean_S1扫地机器人.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["网络要求（与产品一致）","服务边界","产品限制"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-SMARTHOME-002","YX-PRODUCT-S1-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents"],"metadata":{"domain":"smarthome","product":"JoyClean S1","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0055","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"JoyCook R1 Pro 的预设和口感调节是怎么工作的？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"R1 Pro 有 12 个预设程序，支持口感三档（偏软/标准/偏硬）；口感调节需在 App 中保存设置并选择对应米种预设。","expected_facts":[{"label":"R1 Pro 预设程序 12 个","all_of":[{"any_of":["R1 Pro","JoyCook R1 Pro"]},{"any_of":["预设程序","预设"]}],"numbers":["12"]},{"label":"口感三档：偏软/标准/偏硬","all_of":[{"any_of":["口感三档","三档口感","口感"]},{"any_of":["偏软"]},{"any_of":["标准"]},{"any_of":["偏硬"]}]},{"label":"口感调节需在 App 保存设置并选对应预设","all_of":[{"any_of":["App 中","App 里","App 内"]},{"any_of":["保存设置","保存口感","保存"]},{"any_of":["对应米种","对应预设","选择的预设",{"regex":"对应(?:的)?米种(?:预设)?"}]}]}],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/01_产品资料/JoyCook_R1_Pro智能电饭煲.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["核心功能","技术规格","常见使用问题"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-PRODUCT-R1P-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","state_facts"],"metadata":{"domain":"product","product":"JoyCook R1 Pro","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0056","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"我想改收货地址，需要注意什么？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"仅待发货订单可修改地址，每笔订单限 1 次；修改后地址必须仍在原订单市场范围内，送达时效按物流政策重新起算，不再承诺原时效。","expected_facts":["仅待发货订单可改地址","每笔限 1 次","地址须在原订单市场范围内","修改后时效重新起算"],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/03_订单与物流/修改地址政策.md","knowledge-base/03_订单与物流/订单政策.md","knowledge-base/03_订单与物流/物流政策.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["允许修改的时间","修改规则","订单修改","运输时效（参考值）"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-ORDER-002","YX-ORDER-001","YX-LOGISTICS-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","combine_documents","state_conditions"],"metadata":{"domain":"order","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
{"id":"KB-0057","category":"multi_hop","difficulty":"medium","question":"JoyBlend B1 打热饮有什么限制？为什么？","conversation_context":[],"answerable":true,"expected_answer":"B1 搅拌杯容量 1.75L，但热饮液量不超过 1.4L，防止加热溢出。","expected_facts":[{"label":"搅拌杯容量 1.75L","all_of":[{"any_of":["搅拌杯","杯体"]},{"any_of":["总容量","容量"]}],"numbers":["1.75"]},{"label":"热饮液量上限 1.4L","all_of":[{"any_of":["热饮液量","热饮"]},{"any_of":["上限","不超过","不能超过","最多"]}],"numbers":["1.4"],"must_not":["搅拌杯(?:总)?容量.{0,8}1\\.4"]},{"label":"限制目的是防止加热溢出","all_of":[{"any_of":["防止加热时溢出","防止加热溢出","避免溢出",{"regex":"防止加热.{0,12}溢出"}]},{"any_of":["沸腾","溢出","留出空间"]}]}],"ground_truth_documents":["knowledge-base/01_产品资料/JoyBlend_B1高速破壁机.md","knowledge-base/产品主数据.md"],"ground_truth_sections":["产品限制","技术规格","§8 JoyBlend B1 高速破壁机（权威规格）"],"ground_truth_document_ids":["YX-PRODUCT-B1-001","YX-MASTER-001"],"must_cite_source":true,"must_not_hallucinate":true,"expected_behavior":["answer_with_source","state_facts"],"metadata":{"domain":"product","product":"JoyBlend B1","region":"MY","language":"zh-CN"}}
